<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Inco H1 net sharply down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Inco H1 net sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in million U.S. dollars except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 17.04	 vs     39.50</p>
<p>    Sales				89.05	 vs    137.74</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     24.93	 vs     83.44</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 20.93	 vs     52.17</p>
<p>    Other income		     (3.57)	vs	1.23</p>
<p>    Income taxes			7.45	 vs     11.44</p>
<p>    Earnings per share ($)	  0.07	 vs	0.16</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT International Nickel Indonesia is 58.7 percent owned by Inco Ltd of Canada.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364</p>
</text>
